# Definition of done

Complete only when applicable:

- Root cause / requested behavior identified; follows existing architecture
- Business rules enforced outside free-form prompts where required
- Schemas/types valid; relevant tests added/updated
- Lint / typecheck / targeted tests pass; build when appropriate
- Side effects verified truthfully; risks and untested areas disclosed
- No deploy or commit unless explicitly requested

## Final response include

Summary · rationale · files changed · checks run + results · risks · commit? · recommended next model
